# 📈 Executive BI Sales & Performance Dashboard

An interactive multi-page Business Intelligence reporting model developed in Microsoft Power BI and Tableau to deliver executive-level insights on revenue trajectories, category margins, and regional sales distribution.

## 🎯 Objectives & Capabilities
- **C-Level Performance Overview:** Dynamic tracking of Revenue, Gross Profit Margin %, and Order Fulfillment KPIs.
- **Data Modeling:** Robust Star Schema architecture connecting a central `FactSales` table with Date, Customer, and Product dimensions.
- **Time Intelligence:** Interactive Month-over-Month (MoM) and Year-to-Date (YTD) DAX calculations for period comparisons.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack & Tools
- Microsoft Power BI
- Tableau
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- Power Query (ETL & Data Shaping)
